  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table style=\"border: 2px solid #FF6600; border-left: 12px solid #FF6600; margin: -1px 10% 0px; background-color: #fff7f2; vertical-align: middle;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 2px 0 2px 0.5em\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/4b/Under_contruction_icon-red.png/revision/latest?cb=20171205233522\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Under contruction icon-red\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/4b/Under_contruction_icon-red.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20171205233522\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Under contruction icon-red.png\" data-image-key=\"Under_contruction_icon-red.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 0.25em 0.5em; width: 100%;\"><b>The following  page is under construction</b>.\n<p>Please do not edit or alter this article in any way while this template is active. All unauthorized edits may be reverted on the admin's discretion. Propose any changes to the comment section.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"infobox geography vcard vevent\" style=\"width:265px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"3\" class=\"fn org summary\" style=\"text-align:center; line-height:1.2em; font-size:135%; font-weight:bold;\">Northwest American Republic\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align:middle; text-align:center; font-size:115%;\">Unrecognized State/Terrorist Organization\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align:middle; text-align:center; border-top:solid 1px #aaa; padding:0.2em 0em 0.2em 0em;\">\n<table style=\"width:100%; text-align:center; margin:0 auto; background:transparent;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50px; border:0; vertical-align:middle; font-size:30%; line-height:105%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_States_of_America\" title=\"United States of America\"><span style=\"font-size:300%;\">←</span></a> <span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_States_of_America\" title=\"United States of America\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/1/13/US_flag_50_stars.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20150826055828\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"US flag 50 stars.png\" data-image-key=\"US_flag_50_stars.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span><br />&#160;<br /><a href=\"/wiki/Sovereign_Citizen%27s_Alliance\" title=\"Sovereign Citizen&#39;s Alliance\"><span style=\"font-size:300%;\">←</span></a> <span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sovereign_Citizen%27s_Alliance\" title=\"Sovereign Citizen&#39;s Alliance\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/8/84/SCA_Flag_%282030-2031%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20230222172445\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"SCA Flag (2030-2031).png\" data-image-key=\"SCA_Flag_%282030-2031%29.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span><br />\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:middle; text-align:center; font-size:115%; border:0;\"><b>2031–2035</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50px; border:0; vertical-align:middle; text-align:right; line-height:105%; font-size:30%;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_States_of_America\" title=\"United States of America\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"US flag 52stars.png\" data-image-key=\"US_flag_52stars.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/5/58/US_flag_52stars.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20150826055241\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/United_States_of_America\" title=\"United States of America\"><span style=\"font-size:300%;\">→</span></a><br />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"3\" class=\"maptable\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/a/af/Northwest_Territorial_Imperative_flag.png/revision/latest?cb=20230223210335\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Flag of American Redoubt\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"125\" height=\"83\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Northwest Territorial Imperative flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Northwest_Territorial_Imperative_flag.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/a/af/Northwest_Territorial_Imperative_flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/125?cb=20230223210335\" /></a></span><br /> Flag\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align:top; text-align:center; font-size:95%;\"><b>Motto</b><br />The 10% Solution\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Capital</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\">Salmon, ID\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Government</b>\n</td>\n<td>White Nationalist Junta\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Historical era</b>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Flood\" title=\"The Flood\">The Flood</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0em;text-align:left;\">Established\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\">2031\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0em;text-align:left;\">Disestablished\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\">2035\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Currency</b>\n</td>\n<td>NARCoin\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Today part of</b>\n</td>\n<td>United States of America\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The <b>American Redoubt</b> officially the <i>Northwest American Republic</i> (<b>NAR</b>) and sometimes known as the <b>Northwestern Front</b> was a far-right proto-state based mostly in Idaho, Montana, and Wyoming.\n</p><p>The ideas of the Redoubt came from two sources: on top of the original American Redoubt idea intended on creating a community for conservative Christians, the Redoubt later took in ideas of the Northwest Territorial Imperative, which sought to create a White ethno-state in the same region. The flag of the Redoubt would later reflect this. Similar to other far-right rebel governments of the <a href=\"/wiki/White_Tide\" title=\"White Tide\">White Tide</a>, the American Redoubt was characterized by ultraconservatism and racism. Unlike some other far-right rebels, the American Redoubt was not based upon historical independence movements, and solely cared about creating a state for the White race, and not some geographic area (e.g. the South). Eventually, even after the federal government would eliminate most insurgents, violence would periodically break out in Idaho. Even after most of the White Tide ceased in the early 2030s, federal troops would later continue with rooting out insurgents from the Rocky Mountains until the fall of Salmon Idaho in 2035.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119210017\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1004/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 10285/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1829/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/100\nExpensive parser function count: 14/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.002/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 639952/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.001      1 -total\n 96.81%   43.564      1 Template:Infobox_former_country\n 61.63%   27.735      2 Template:Ns0\n 55.69%   25.060      1 Template:Infobox_former_country/autocat\n 26.93%   12.119      2 Template:Str_find\n  4.19%    1.884      2 Template:Ordinal\n  3.08%    1.387      1 Template:WIP\n  2.80%    1.260      1 Template:Both\n  2.15%    0.969      1 Template:Main_other\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:3670-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261119210017 and revision id 11134. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
